{"id":"n82621-1-7","stage":5,"title":"튼튼히 · 结实地","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82621-1-7-1","ko":"이렇게 의자가 작은 충격에도 부서지면 어떡해?","zh":"这椅子稍微一碰就散架，怎么行？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"의자가","meaning":"椅子","explanation":"의자：椅子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"의자","audio":"/audio/e8bb0f33e8ba6ddcf691.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71121","senseId":"1","lemma":"의자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작은","meaning":"小","explanation":"작다：小；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"작다","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69513","senseId":"3","lemma":"작다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"충격에도","meaning":"冲击","explanation":"충격：冲击；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"충격","audio":"/audio/947753405607bd73444a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66310","senseId":"1","lemma":"충격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부서지면","meaning":"坏，被毁坏","explanation":"부서지다：坏，被毁坏；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"부서지다","audio":"/audio/1adedab084e1d1b96c5c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26318","senseId":"3","lemma":"부서지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떡해?","meaning":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어떡하다：“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떡하다","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70480","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"e8bb0f33e8ba6ddc","term":"의자","zh":"椅子","audio":"/audio/e8bb0f33e8ba6ddcf691.mp3","entryId":"71121","definition":"供人以臀部和大腿接触倚坐的器具。","pronunciation":["의자"]},{"id":"bc42f85bf5be37c9","term":"작다","zh":"小","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3","entryId":"69513","definition":"工作的规模、范围、程度及重要性等都不及于其他或一般水平。","pronunciation":["작ː따"]},{"id":"947753405607bd73","term":"충격","zh":"冲击","audio":"/audio/947753405607bd73444a.mp3","entryId":"66310","definition":"迅猛地向物体施加的力。","pronunciation":["충격"]},{"id":"1adedab084e1d1b9","term":"부서지다","zh":"坏，被毁坏","audio":"/audio/1adedab084e1d1b96c5c.mp3","entryId":"26318","definition":"拥有一定结构的东西被弄坏，变得无法使用。","pronunciation":["부서지다"]},{"id":"e39300a264725a21","term":"어떡하다","zh":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3","entryId":"70480","definition":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/26c7cd15ff06cffde785.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82621-1-7-2","ko":"이런, 다음에는 좀 더 튼튼히 만들어야겠는걸.","zh":"哎呀，下次得做结实一点。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이런,","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"이런：啊，哎呀","readings":[{"term":"이런","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89753","senseId":"1","lemma":"이런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음에는","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"튼튼히","meaning":"结实地，坚硬地","explanation":"튼튼히：结实地，坚硬地","readings":[{"term":"튼튼히","audio":"/audio/d298b18bbdd8949bbd10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82621","senseId":"1","lemma":"튼튼히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만들어야겠는걸.","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；는걸：表示新发现、感叹或与对方预期不同的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"82a16d424583893e","term":"이런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3","entryId":"89753","definition":"看到或者听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["이런"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"d298b18bbdd8949b","term":"튼튼히","zh":"结实地，坚硬地","audio":"/audio/d298b18bbdd8949bbd10.mp3","entryId":"82621","definition":"非常坚固刚硬地。","pronunciation":["튼튼히"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a53995a4d89fa7241dc5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.309,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82621","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":158,"sequenceScore":3.1357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这椅子稍微一碰就散架，怎么行？","哎呀，下次得做结实一点。","听说你这个月领到奖金了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这椅子稍微一碰就散架，怎么行？","哎呀，下次得做结实一点。","听说你这个月领到奖金了？"],"answer":1}]}
